{"ref":"BDB, צָחַק","hw":"צָחַק","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָחַק</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. laugh (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">ضَحِكَ</span>, <em>laugh</em>, Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܚܶܟ</span>, cf. Ba<sup>ES 34</sup>; v. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׂחַק\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׂחַק\", dir=\"rtl\">שׂחק</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽחֲקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">Gn 18:13</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצֲחַק־</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:6\" href=\"/Genesis.21.6\">Gn 21:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּצְחָ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:17\" href=\"/Genesis.17.17\">17:17</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּצְחַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">18:12</a>;—<em>laugh</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:12\" href=\"/Genesis.18.12\">Gn 18:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:13\" href=\"/Genesis.18.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:15\" href=\"/Genesis.18.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 17:17\" href=\"/Genesis.17.17\">17:17</a> (P); c. ל <em>at, concerning</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:6\" href=\"/Genesis.21.6\">21:6</a>.<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:25\" href=\"/Judges.16.25\">Ju 16:25</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:6\" href=\"/Exodus.32.6\">Ex 32:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">(בִּי) לְצַ֫חֶק בָּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:14\" href=\"/Genesis.39.14\">Gn 39:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:17\" href=\"/Genesis.39.17\">17</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַחֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:14\" href=\"/Genesis.19.14\">Gn 19:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">26:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַחֶ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:9\" href=\"/Genesis.21.9\">21:9</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>jest</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:14\" href=\"/Genesis.19.14\">Gn 19:14</a> (J). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>sport, play</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:9\" href=\"/Genesis.21.9\">Gn 21:9</a> (E); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:6\" href=\"/Exodus.32.6\">Ex 32:6</a> (J); <em>make sport</em> for <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:25\" href=\"/Judges.16.25\">Ju 16:25</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וִישַׂחֶק־לָ֑נוּ</span>); <em>toy with</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶת)</span>, of conjugal caresses <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:8\" href=\"/Genesis.26.8\">Gn 26:8</a> (cf. Doughty<sup>Arab. Des. i. 231</sup>), <em>make a toy of</em>, c. ב, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:14\" href=\"/Genesis.39.14\">39:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 39:17\" href=\"/Genesis.39.17\">17</a> (all J).","next":"BDB, צְחֹק","prev":"BDB, צַחֲנָה"}